{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119680","id":3733348077,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7ehl7t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119680","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119680.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119680.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119680","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119680/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119680/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119680/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/4b504ee1f011fb617663ca496c500a1a1add6f76","number":119680,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Add `directional_shadow_min_fov` to DirectionalLight3D","user":{"login":"Pizzaandy","id":47232037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MjMyMDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47232037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy","html_url":"https://github.com/Pizzaandy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Pizzaandy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Partially addresses #72015\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nThis PR adds `directional_shadow_min_fov` to DirectionalLight3D to address the problem of shadow flickering when the camera FOV is animated (e.g. sprinting in an FPS game). This comes at the cost of shadow quality.\r\n\r\n~~One change I'm not sure about is to [this line](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/f08e003ff23a667c24c76c0193ba31a02b5dae99/servers/rendering/renderer_scene_cull.cpp#L2211) that passes `Projection::get_fov` as the Y FOV of the light frustum. This seems incorrect to me and computing `Projection::get_fovy` proper appears to produce sharper shadows. This seems like it could be a breaking change - let me know if it needs to be removed or added to a separate PR.~~\r\nEdit: reverted this change\r\n\r\n\r\n### Master:\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/96f65be1-bc3c-487b-9bbf-db0fba741b80\r\n\r\n\r\n### PR (`directional_shadow_min_fov` = 100):\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a3394cbf-8ff9-450e-b62f-e40540867a36\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098111,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgxMTE=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:rendering","name":"topic:rendering","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godo